# "From the right question to a considered solution"
process:
  - word: Understand
    title: Start with the people and the problem
    text: >-
      I clarify who the experience is for, what they need to do, and what constraints matter.
      That gives the team a shared starting point before we settle on a solution.
    badges: [Problem framing, User needs, Product context]
  - word: Design
    title: Explore and shape the experience
    text: >-
      I map flows, explore interface directions, and make ideas tangible.
      I use feedback to refine the structure and details, keeping the experience coherent and usable.
    badges: [User flows, Wireframes, UI design, Prototypes]
  - word: Deliver
    title: Work through the details together
    text: >-
      I communicate decisions and work through details with the people building the product.
      I care about consistency and the practical conditions that shape the final experience.
    badges: [Design systems, Cross-functional collaboration, Handoff]

